      "id": "part-000338-01",
      "label": "2-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "配制 $\\ce{SnCl2}$ 溶液时,将 $\\ce{SnCl2(s)}$ 溶于浓 HCl 后再加水冲稀。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000338-02",
      "label": "2-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "加热 $\\ce{MnO2}$ 的浓 HCl 溶液制取氯气。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000338-03",
      "label": "2-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "需用浓 HCl 溶液配制王水才能溶解金。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
